+// DOS-PORT (patch 0128, Phase 11 wave-33 H3 visit-loop simplification --
+// slot 0113 extension). Killswitch for the FG/BG tilemap-loop bounds-
+// check elimination optimization. When ENABLED (default), the inner-
+// loop body in map.cpp's `_tilemap_render_uncached_full_loop` dispatches
+// to a `<bounds_known=true>` template instantiation whenever bbox-skip
